              <name>IMPLEMENTER</name>
              <description>Implementer Code\nContains the JEP106 code of the company that implemented the IP: - [11:8]: JEP106 continuation code of implementer. - [7]: Always 0. - [6:0]: JEP106 identity code of implementer. For Arm this field reads as 0x43B.</description>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>12</bitWidth>
