              <description>Software Trigger Edge-detect Brake Source (Write Only) (Write Protect)\nWrite 1 to this bit will trigger PWM edge-detect brake source, then BRKEIF0 and BRKEIF1 will be set to 1 automatically in TIMERx_PWMINTSTS1 register. \nNote: This bit is write protected. Refer toSYS_REGLCTL register.</description>
