          <resetValue>0x00000000</resetValue>
          <resetMask>0xFFFFFFFF</resetMask>
          <fields>
            <field>
              <name>CNTSEN</name>
              <description>BPWM Counter Synchronous Start Enable Bit (Write Only)\nBPMW counter synchronous enable function is used to make EPWM or BPWM channels start counting at the same time.\nWriting this bit to 1 will also set the counter enable bit if correlated BPWM channel counter synchronous start function is enabled.</description>
