              <description>BPWM Period or Center Point Control\nEach bit n controls the corresponding BPWM channel n.\nBPWM can control output level when BPWM counter count to (PERIOD+1).\nNote: This bit is center point control when BPWM counter is operating in up-down counter type.</description>
