              <description>Source Address\nWhen this bit is set, the MAC Address6[47:0] is used to compare with the SA fields of the received frame. When this bit is reset, the MAC Address6[47:0] is used to compare with the DA fields of the received frame.</description>
              <bitOffset>30</bitOffset>
