            <field>
              <name>AE</name>
              <description>Address Enable\nWhen this bit is set, the address filter module uses the seventh MAC address for perfect filtering. When this bit is reset, the address filter module ignores the address for filtering.</description>
              <bitOffset>31</bitOffset>
