              <name>ADDRLO</name>
              <description>MAC Address7 [31:0]\nThis field contains the lower 32 bits of the eighth 6-byte MAC address. The content of this field is undefined until loaded by the Application after the initialization process.</description>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
