                    <description>USB event occurred on Endpoint 9. Check USBD_EPSTS1[7:4] to know which kind of USB event was occurred, cleared by writing 1 to USBD_INTSTS[25] or USBD_EPINTSTS[9] or USBD_INTSTS[1]</description>
